["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"HoP 499 Beyond Belief: Bayle, Toleration, and Atheism invincible ignorance Manichaeism Theophrastus Redivivus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-hopwag-第一个公开的无神论者-其实是个不敢出书的乡村神父/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">23:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>第一個公開的無神論者，其實是個不敢出書的鄉村神父</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梅利耶寫下了否定上帝存在的《遺書》，卻只敢抄三份留給身後；貝爾則用懷疑論證明，宗教問題超出理性，因此沒人有資格以信仰之名迫害他人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">無神論</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教寬容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1357: Furin, Naturally with Paul Bieinasz furin cleavage site NSP15 RXXR sarbecovirus OC43\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-twiv-造一个-furin-位点根本不难-难的是承认它不罕见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>造一個 furin 位點根本不難，難的是承認它不罕見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">深度測序顯示，冠狀病毒基因組裡每千個就有幾個帶插入，furin 位點在同一位置至少被獨立撞上三次——實驗室起源論的概率論證站不住腳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒學</span><span class=\"tag\">深度測序</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The First Punic War corvus Mamertines Mix-Hellenes Monte Fortino\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ancients-罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦-第一次布匿战争的关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬的勝利靠一隻烏鴉：第一次布匿戰爭的關鍵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬靠一種叫 corvus 的登船吊橋把海戰變成陸戰，抵消了迦太基的水手優勢；但迦太基請來一位斯巴達人重整軍隊，反手俘虜了羅馬執政官。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"92. Is Poor Nutrition a Supply Problem or a Demand Problem? food desert external locus of control Nielsen Home Scan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-nostupid-开一家新超市-只解决-10-的营养不平等/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>開一家新超市，只解決 10% 的營養不平等</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把健康食品的供給鋪到低收入社區，只能縮小約 10% 的營養不平等，剩下 90% 由需求端決定——而需求是可以被稅收和文化改變的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 252 - The Ice Age icehouse greenhouse cirque dropstone albedo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-thecommondesce-冰期不是无尽的冬天-而是反复的分合/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://pbcdn1.podbean.com/imglogo/image-logo/1598752/CommonDescentLogo.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>冰期不是無盡的冬天，而是反覆的分合</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冰期與間冰期來回切換，把種群反覆隔離又重連，這才是冰期塑造物種的真正機制；而人類活動可能把下一次冰期推遲數十萬年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古氣候</span><span class=\"tag\">冰川</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"363: Why Vegetables Are Good for Your Heart settle plate DNIC EPR sGC mTORC1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-thisweekinmicr-本生灯不减少平板污染-蔬菜护心另有机制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/edf553b27ee2c1ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>本生燈不減少平板汙染，蔬菜護心另有機制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本生燈在低汙染環境下反而可能增加沉降菌落；蔬菜護心可能不是硝酸鹽-亞硝酸鹽-NO 通路，而是腸道菌把硝酸鹽和鐵做成 DNIC 直接激活 sGC。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">微生物學</span><span class=\"tag\">無菌操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"We Asked Fidelity&#x27;s Ex-President What Made Peter Lynch Great — and Where Private Credit Risk Hides private credit affiliated investments rating shopping auto-IRA reversion to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-excessreturns-私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>私募信貸的風險藏在保險公司的評級裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募信貸大量進入保險公司，且多為關聯方投資，評級由私營機構給出、系統性偏高；若按正確評級，保險公司每年要多留 4000-5000 億美元資本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募信貸</span><span class=\"tag\">保險公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The History of Perfume: Mankind&#x27;s Millennia Long Battle Against Stank miasma theory ambergris nosegay fixative\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-extracredits-人类几千年对抗恶臭-香水最初是烧给神的烟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffaf32042b4c196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">16:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>人類幾千年對抗惡臭，香水最初是燒給神的煙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香水不是從奢侈享受開始的，而是從宗教焚香和防病開始的——歐洲人相信難聞的空氣會傳播疾病，於是用香味把自己圍起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香水史</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教儀式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Astra as AGI, OpenAI&#x27;s Pause, Mythos @ Mozilla &amp; Human Agency vs Technocapitalism agent workday METR paper clipper safe harbor Dyson sphere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-cogrev-astra-跨过-agi-门槛-但没人能审计它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/36e51d00f0d50003-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>Astra 跨過 AGI 門檻，但沒人能審計它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Astra 讓人類再也不用做某些任務，OpenAI 卻只暫停了一半 RL 算力；外部審計被卡死在發布前兩三天，房間裡沒有大人可以接鍋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">Astra</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Open Models Change The Economics of AI harness open weights router MLX DGX Spark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-ycsp-企业最终八成-token-走开源模型-但只花两成预算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f442bffca180d6cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">57:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>企業最終八成 token 走開源模型，但只花兩成預算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開源模型和閉源前沿模型不是替代關係：絕大多數 token 會走開源，最難的活留給前沿實驗室，中間靠路由和編排把兩者接起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Flexner Report Flexner Report AAMC The Usefulness of Useless Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-stuffmissed-一份报告关掉上百所医学院-黑人医生从此断层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>一份報告關掉上百所醫學院，黑人醫生從此斷層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flexner Report 常被寫成醫學教育現代化的起點，但它同時讓七所黑人醫學院關掉五所，此後近四十年沒有新的黑人醫學院出現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學教育</span><span class=\"tag\">種族不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1105 - Sep 12 2026 physical reservoir computing island of stability coronagraph contingent learning big rip\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-skeptics-改一条物理定律-每个愿望都会反噬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>改一條物理定律，每個願望都會反噬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dragon Con 現場的思想實驗：只能改一條物理定律讓科幻成真，結果每個願望都被拆出沒算進去的後果——反重力等於免費能源，超空間旅行等於把技術送給所有外星文明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理定律</span><span class=\"tag\">太空望遠鏡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Judith Dada on the Rise of the AfD model routing Pareto-frontier model Migrationshintergrund Aktienrente tech-brosphere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-goodfight-德国车败给中国电动车-afd-崛起只是症状/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>德國車敗給中國電動車，AfD 崛起只是症狀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AfD 不是德國問題而是西方問題：人們覺得明天不會更好，而德國引以為傲的汽車、化工、鐵路同時失去競爭力，才是極右翼真正的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歐洲科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AfD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Companies Are Becoming a Series of Loops | Anish Acharya on Lenny’s Podcast autocatalytic effects RSI out of distribution thinking cornered resource revealed preferences stated preferences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-a16z-公司正在变成一串嵌套的-loop-但-loop-只能爬到局部最优/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>公司正在變成一串嵌套的 loop，但 loop 只能爬到局部最優</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">prompt 之後是 agent，agent 之後是 loop。loop 會幫你爬到局部最大值然後平臺化，這時需要人的直覺幫你落到下一座山的山腳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent</span><span class=\"tag\">loop</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Friedland on the World&#x27;s Monumental Shortage of Copper NPV model heap leach tailings dam solid oxide fuel cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-oddlots-铜矿品位从2-跌到0-4-ai的电力需求却要上天/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>銅礦品位從2%跌到0.4%，AI的電力需求卻要上天</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球銅礦品位持續下滑、新礦審批要35年，而AI搜索耗電是普通搜索的30倍——供給在萎縮，需求在爆炸，銅正在變成新的石油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">銅</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"20VC: 7 Predictions for How AI Changes the World: Labour, Engineering, Social Media, GrokBots Buying Cybercabs and more with Matteo Franceschetti, Co-Founder @ Eight Sleep BOM COGS CAC incrementality test\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-twentyvc-工程师一年前就不写代码了-ai-员工让公司规模翻三倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/78efdf2666aab65e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>工程師一年前就不寫代碼了，AI 員工讓公司規模翻三倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Eight Sleep 的郵件營銷團隊從 2 人變 0 人，年收入接近 1 億美元；工程師一年前停止寫代碼，用幾百個 AI 工程師替代。Matteo 開始統計「人類員工」和「AI 員工」，把 AI 算進來公司規模是現在的三到四倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 員工</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1356: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MACE Bundibugyo virus immune amnesia target trial emulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-twiv-美国麻疹卷土重来-cdc-拒绝承认两例儿童死亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>美國麻疹捲土重來：CDC 拒絕承認兩例兒童死亡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">賓州兩例麻疹死亡被 CDC 從週報裡抹掉，理由是「信息不足」——但 CDC 自己就參與了那場調查。先例比個案更危險：州上報的法定傳染病數據，從此可以被聯邦以未公開標準駁回。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1356: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MACE Bundibugyo virus notifiable disease report target trial emulation immune amnesia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-twiv-美国麻疹死婴被从cdc数据里抹掉-州报告权正在被联邦接管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">47:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>美國麻疹死嬰被從CDC數據裡抹掉，州報告權正在被聯邦接管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CDC 拒絕把賓州兩例麻疹死亡計入全國統計，理由是「信息不足」——但 CDC 自己就參與了那次調查。先例比個案更危險：州報告變成可談判的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Kills Everybody or Doomer Psyop? OpenAI&#x27;s Math Breakthrough, Nike&#x27;s $200B Collapse Doomer RSI ZDR S-1 DTC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-allin-ai-末日论是场心理战-靶子是开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e7d0b1750f8c272-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 末日論是場心理戰，靶子是開源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 一邊請公開市場以萬億估值承保自己，一邊由安全負責人背書「AI 可能終結文明」——這不是內部矛盾，是一場以開源為最終靶子的監管鋪墊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Finding Stability in Investing: Masters in Business with Seth Bernstein ad valorem pricing K-1 glide path SMA superannuation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-mastersinbiz-主动管理巨头把总部搬去纳什维尔-一年省下8500万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">59:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>主動管理巨頭把總部搬去納什維爾，一年省下8500萬美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alliance Bernstein 從紐約遷往納什維爾，每年省下約8500萬美元，且不強迫任何基金經理搬家——省的是地產和人員成本，賭的是能招到紐約招不到的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產管理</span><span class=\"tag\">私募信貸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Fruitfly Hard Takeoff, Washington on AI Risk, 𝕏 Timeline Reactions | Thijs Simonian, Alex Heath &amp; Guy Oseary, Mitesh Agrawal AI 2040 SO-100 commodity memory CoWoS gigawatt plus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-tbpn-ai-2040-不是停掉-ai-是把超级智能推迟到-2040/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2040 不是停掉 AI，是把超級智能推遲到 2040</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反 AI 提案的真實機制是算力上限：暫停新前沿訓練，只允許推理，用 1 MB/s 的對外連接和法拉第籠把偷權重變成不可能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Chansons de Geste and 12th Century Performance Sample Chanson de Geste laisse decasyllabic meter oliphant jongleur Anglo-Norman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-britishhist-最古老的-罗兰之歌-抄本-其实是个英国人的演出本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>最古老的《羅蘭之歌》抄本，其實是個英國人的演出本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">牛津 Digby 23 抄本用盎格魯-諾曼方言寫成，學者靠方言漂移把它定在 1140 到 1170 年之間——這首法國史詩最完整的版本，是演給英國人聽的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀</span><span class=\"tag\">手稿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: 9.11, Death of the Army, So Long Dan Driscoll op-tempo MRAP ATGM Ranger tab OODA loop distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-chinatalk-陆军部长辞职-最会打仗的人先被清掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccd87d69de9eb025-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>陸軍部長辭職：最會打仗的人先被清掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">9·11 後 25 年，美軍一直在跑步機上：預算被戰爭吃掉，轉型只能靠便宜技術硬上，而真正懂技術、敢冒險的軍官正被一批批清出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防</span><span class=\"tag\">美軍轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI researchers debate how close we are to recursive self-improvement RSI sim-to-real gap mid-training entropy collapse logit distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-dwarkesh-ai-研究员两年提速-10-倍-但-rsi-可能比当律师助理更容易/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bcdcaa041341c8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究員兩年提速 10 倍，但 RSI 可能比當律師助理更容易</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 是累積型任務，理論上一個不到百萬 token 的 Python 文件就能從零訓出可遞歸自我改進的模型；而律所法務助理要記住不斷變化的人際關係和隱性做事方式，是非平穩分布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span>\n</div></div></a>"]